00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:44.000
And the art market shows no signs of slowing
down.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:49.570
Contemporary art outpaced the S&amp;P 500  by 
174% in the last decade.

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:54.180
That's almost triple the appreciation of real
estate and gold during the same period according

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.180
to Citibank.

00:05:55.180 --> 00:06:00.110
So it  wasn't surprising when I read in The Wall Street Journal
that “art is among the hottest markets on

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:01.449
earth right now”

00:06:01.449 --> 00:06:05.509
It's grown 2700% in the last 20 years!

00:06:05.509 --> 00:06:09.810
If you’d like to diversify your portfolio,
you can sign up for Masterworks with my custom

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:11.690
link in the description.

00:06:11.690 --> 00:06:12.970
Thanks for watching.

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:15.878
For Newsthink, I’m Cindy Pom.

